machine-whoami (1.4-1) stable; urgency=low

  * Replace DEVICE_SUBNET with DEVICE_SUBNET4 and DEVICE_SUBNET6, derived
    from the device's primary IPv4 and IPv6 addresses respectively; each is
    empty if unset. Scripts reading DEVICE_SUBNET must be updated. The
    format change rewrites every device file once.
  * License under Apache-2.0
  * Documentation updates; test data uses example.com and documentation
    address ranges

 -- Bryan Wann <bwann@wann.net>  Tue, 27 Oct 2026 13:53:29 -0700

